{'symbol': 'VLO', 'date': '2021-08-27 08:55:00', 'title': 'VALERO ENERGY CORPORATION ANNOUNCES THE REDEMPTION OF FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2023', 'text': 'SAN ANTONIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VALERO ENERGY CORPORATION (NYSE: VLO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL REDEEM THE ENTIRE OUTSTANDING PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2023 (THE “NOTES”) AS PART OF ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO REDUCE DEBT. THE REDEMPTION DATE FOR THE NOTES IS SEPTEMBER 27, 2021. THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE NOTES OUTSTANDING IS $575 MILLION. THE REDEMPTION PRICE FOR THE NOTES WILL BE EQUAL TO 100% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE NOTES OUTSTANDING, PLU'}